Use the shared repository rules in @AGENTS.md.

## Token Budget

- Keep context small: inspect only files directly relevant to the current task.
- Use precise `rg` searches before opening files.
- Exclude `firmware/external`, build trees, generated files, IDE caches, and vendored code unless explicitly needed.
- Read focused ranges instead of whole long files.
- Do not paste full file contents or long code blocks into chat unless requested.
- Keep responses concise; summarize only decisions, changes, and verification.
- Do not re-read rules/templates/README files unless the task is about them.
